        "department": null,
        "description": "This course considers a computer as a stand alone device. It deals with basic computer functionality, and how it is realized in software. We deal in detail with the hardware organization that delivers it. The layers in the computer organization are revealed systematically and the manner in which organizational components are managed is described. The course lays the basis for more advanced topics in computer science, both hardware and software.",
